* Decision pattern: review is explicit instead of treating submission as immediate.
Goal: Submit a completed form
. Goal: Review entered information
.. Read <entered name>
.. Recall <actual name>
.. Verify <entered name> matches <actual name>
.. Read <entered address>
.. Recall <actual address>
.. Verify <entered address> matches <actual address>
. Goal: Correct information if needed
.. Look at <field to correct>
.. Click <field to correct>
.. Hands to keyboard
.. Type <corrected value>
. Goal: Submit form
.. Hands to mouse
.. Look at <submit button>
.. Click <submit button>
.. Verify form is submitted
